option.FOG_DENSITY=Mist Density
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts the thickness of distant atmospheric mist and the Valley Sea of Clouds.

option.LIGHT_SHAFTS=Light Shafts
value.LIGHT_SHAFTS.0=Off
value.LIGHT_SHAFTS.1=Soft
value.LIGHT_SHAFTS.2=Full
option.LIGHT_SHAFTS.comment=Sunlight and moonlight shafts in mist and underwater. Soft uses fewer samples and lower intensity; Full uses more samples and stronger shafts.
option.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_STRENGTH=Atmospheric Shaft Strength
option.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts sunlight and moonlight beams in air. Does not change underwater shafts or general mist density. Direct light must reach the opening.

option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Reflections
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.0=Sky Only
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.1=Fast SSR
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.2=Full SSR
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=Sky Only reflects the atmosphere without clouds or objects. Fast and Full add reflected volumetric clouds and screen-space objects; Full uses more samples. Off-screen objects cannot be reflected.

