value.SUN_LENS_FLARE.1=Soft
value.SUN_LENS_FLARE.2=Full
option.SUN_LENS_FLARE.comment=Two thin, view-dependent rainbow arcs and two matching lens ghosts around a visible sun. Fades near screen edges, behind terrain, and in rain.
