option.SUN_SIZE.comment=Scales the sun and moon together, including their artwork and rings.
option.BIOME_TINT_STRENGTH.comment=Controls biome-dependent atmosphere colors. Does not directly change block texture tint.
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Higher resolution sharpens shadow detail and uses more GPU memory.
option.shadowDistance.comment=Shadow rendering distance in blocks. Larger distances cost more and spread the shadow map over a wider area.
option.SHADOW_FILTER_QUALITY.comment=Controls shadow filtering samples. Higher settings soften edges at a higher rendering cost.
option.WIND_SPEED.comment=Shared animation speed for foliage, water waves and shoreline foam.
option.WAVING_SUGARCANE.comment=Animates reeds and related mapped plants, including their shadows.
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH=Vignette Strength
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH.comment=Screen-edge shading: silk tint in Guofeng, cinematic darkening in Xianxia, and underwater darkening. 0 disables; 1 retains the original look.
option.EXPOSURE=Exposure Adjustment
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Adjusts brightness before the existing tone curve. 0 retains the original look. This is manual artistic exposure, not automatic adaptation.
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.SATURATION.comment=Adjusts color intensity relative to the selected style. 1 retains its original colors.
option.PAINTERLY_WASH_STRENGTH=Painterly Wash
option.PAINTERLY_WASH_STRENGTH.comment=Guofeng only: blends nearby surface colors for a painted appearance. 0 disables; 1 retains the original wash.
option.PAPER_GRAIN_STRENGTH=Paper Grain
option.PAPER_GRAIN_STRENGTH.comment=Guofeng only: controls the fine paper texture. 0 disables; 1 retains the original texture.
option.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION_STRENGTH=Underwater Distortion
option.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the underwater screen ripple. 0 disables; 1 retains the original ripple. Does not change water fog or light rays.
value.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH.0.00=Off
value.PAINTERLY_WASH_STRENGTH.0.00=Off
value.PAPER_GRAIN_STRENGTH.0.00=Off
value.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION_STRENGTH.0.00=Off

option.ANTI_ALIASING=Anti-aliasing
value.ANTI_ALIASING.0=Off
value.ANTI_ALIASING.1=Subtle
value.ANTI_ALIASING.2=Smooth
value.ANTI_ALIASING.3=Temporal
option.ANTI_ALIASING.comment=Subtle and Smooth soften edges within each frame. Temporal combines frames to reduce distant shimmer, with higher memory use and possible softness in fine detail.
option.MOTION_BLUR=Motion Blur
value.MOTION_BLUR.0=Off
value.MOTION_BLUR.1=Fast
value.MOTION_BLUR.2=Smooth
option.MOTION_BLUR.comment=Blurs camera and wind-animated foliage motion while protecting held items and depth edges. Smooth also estimates visible entity motion at higher rendering cost.
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH=Motion Blur Strength
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the shutter effect. 0 disables visible blur; switch Motion Blur to Off to skip the blur pass entirely.
value.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH.0.00=Off
